          "unit": "x",
          "direction": "max",
          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "Beginning with the quarter ended September 30, 2008, the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio, for the four consecutive fiscal quarter period ending as of each fiscal quarter end, shall be greater than or equal to (i) 1.15 to 1.0 for each fiscal quarter during the fiscal year 2009 and (ii) 1.20 to 1.0 for each fiscal quarter thereafter."
